sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FE as 🎨 Frontend
    participant API as 🚀 API Gateway
    participant ML as 🤖 ML Service
    participant FeatureEng as 🔧 Feature Engineering
    participant Model as 🏋️ Model (XGBoost)
    participant NBA as 🎯 NBA Engine
    participant DB as 🗄️ PostgreSQL
    participant Scheduler as ⏰ Scheduler

    Note over FE, Scheduler: DAILY BATCH (03:00 UTC)
    Scheduler->>API: Trigger daily forecast
    API->>ML: POST /predict/win-probability (batch 500 deals)
    ML->>FeatureEng: build_deal_features(deal_ids)
    FeatureEng->>DB: Complex SQL (CTEs: temporal, owner, stage, company, activity)
    DB-->>FeatureEng: Feature matrix (500 x 80 features)
    FeatureEng-->>ML: Feature matrix
    ML->>Model: predict(features)
    Model-->>ML: win_probabilities (500 floats)
    ML->>NBA: generate_actions(deal, prob)
    NBA->>NBA: Evaluate rules (stale_high_prob, closing_no_activity, etc.)
    NBA-->>ML: Top 3 actions per deal
    ML-->>API: {deal_id, win_prob, risk, actions}[]
    API->>DB: UPDATE oportunidades SET ml_score=?, risk_level=?
    API-->>FE: WebSocket push → DealForecastCard update
    
    Note over FE, Scheduler: REAL-TIME (on deal change)
    FE->>API: PUT /api/oportunidades/:id (stage change)
    API->>DB: UPDATE oportunidad + emitEvent('oportunidad.actualizada')
    API->>ML: POST /predict/win-probability (single deal)
    ML->>FeatureEng: build_deal_features([deal_id])
    FeatureEng->>DB: Real-time features (activity count, days_in_stage)
    DB-->>FeatureEng: Fresh features
    FeatureEng-->>ML: Features
    ML->>Model: predict([features])
    Model-->>ML: prob (0.73)
    ML->>NBA: generate_actions(deal, 0.73)
    NBA-->>ML: [{rule: 'stale_high_prob', action: '...', priority: 1}]
    ML-->>API: {win_prob: 0.73, risk: 'low', actions: [...]}
    API-->>FE: WebSocket → DealForecastCard update + NBAFeed push